      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "\nIndividuals who, while sharing the caravan\u2019s goal of escaping the
    <b>Black Breath</b>, possess the means to defend it and contribute to the cause.\n\nCombat-related
    attributes, such as defense, saving throws, etc., are explained in the Combat
    Handbook section.\n\n<b>---Progress</b>\n\nEach character class possesses a set
    of intrinsic abilities (always active) and 8 Common Abilities.\nEach character
    starts with 2 random Common Abilities from their class.\n\nAs characters level
    up, they will unlock new Common Abilities, as well as 2 superior abilities exclusive
    to their class."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 54a3d28dd6785154fac83f0c31a69b7c, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 1369702316804459117, guid: 54a3d28dd6785154fac83f0c31a69b7c, type: 2}
  m_fontSharedMaterials: []
  m_fontMaterial: {fileID: 0}
