  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<b>---Variations</b>\n\nFor both Fumbles and Critical Hits, some Units
    have their range passively modified.\nFor example, the Knight has the detrimental
    passive \u201CLimiting Armor\u201D, which increases the Fumble range by 1.\nAs
    a result, if their 1d20 roll is a 2, it still counts as a Fumble.\n\n<b>---Saving
    Throws (ST)</b>\n\nSome Abilities apply negative effects only if the target fails
    a Saving Throw.\nThis roll functions similarly to an Attack vs Defense check,
    but in this case, the target\u2019s ST value is tested against the DC (Difficulty
    Class) of the enemy Ability.\nIf the result equals or exceeds the DC, the target
    resists the effect.\n\nThere are three types of Saving Throws:\nFortitude, Reflex,
    and Mind, each protecting against different kinds of effects."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 54a3d28dd6785154fac83f0c31a69b7c, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 1369702316804459117, guid: 54a3d28dd6785154fac83f0c31a69b7c, type: 2}
