  m_text: "Let\u2019s get into action.\n\nYour stalker can use <b>Hand Crossbow Shot</b>
    on the enemy <b>Tamed Dog</b>.\nThis is a ranged skill that costs <b>3 AP</b>
    and can hit any enemy within its reach.\n\nSelect the skill on the action bar
    below (or press <b>\u201C2\u201D</b>)."
