  m_text: "<b>---Effects</b>\n\nAt the beginning of a Unit\u2019s Turn, it will receive
    the effects of any Status conditions it currently has. For example, if the Unit
    is on fire, it will take the appropriate damage at the start of its turn.\n\nAs
    for Buffs and Debuffs (attribute-altering effects, positive or negative), their
    duration is reduced at the end of the Unit\u2019s Turn. When a Buff\u2019s duration
    reaches 0, it is removed."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 54a3d28dd6785154fac83f0c31a69b7c, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 1369702316804459117, guid: 54a3d28dd6785154fac83f0c31a69b7c, type: 2}
