      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "The main purpose of your caravan is to safely escort as many Civilians
    as possible to the city <b>Port of Serria</b>.\n\nThese Civilians will later
    become an important resource for your future runs, as they will provide various
    forms of assistance to upcoming caravans; forming part of the game\u2019s meta-progression
    system.\n\nTherefore, ensuring their well-being is very important.\n\n\n\n<b>---Supplies</b>\n\nWhen
    resting, each Civilian consumes 1 Supply. If you don\u2019t have enough, they
    will begin to starve and Hope will drop drastically. (Each Ox consumes 2 Supplies.)"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 54a3d28dd6785154fac83f0c31a69b7c, type: 2}
