  m_text: "Keep in mind you can rest on almost any type of <b>Node</b>; you won\u2019t
    always find <b>Glades</b>.\n\nWhen you rest, <b>Fatigue</b> is fully removed,
    your <b>Characters</b> recover a percentage of their health, and <b>The Black
    Breath</b> advances.\n\n\nTo rest, press the button indicated by the arrow."
