      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "You\u2019ve entered a <b>Glade</b>. This type of <b>Node</b> is one of
    the best places to <b>Rest</b>, since resting here grants several benefits.\n\nAfter
    traveling without stop, the caravan is now <b>Fatigued</b>. At the top, where
    the arrows point, you can see the caravan\u2019s <b>Energy</b>.\n\nTraveling
    while fatigued has negative effects, and they get worse as fatigue increases."
