  m_text: 'Lastly, each time you manage to reach <b>Serria</b> with a caravan, you
    can assign its <b>Civilians</b> to different tasks within the city, which will
    help future caravans in various ways.


    Both the <b>Gold</b> and the <b>Civilians</b>
    you bring back are important. They are converted into <b>Work Value</b>, the
    currency you use to purchase city upgrades.'
