  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "\nWhen an Attack Roll is successful, a Damage Roll is then made against
    the target.\nThe type of roll and the amount of damage dealt are determined by
    the Ability used.\n\n<b>Armor</b>\n\nFor Physical Attacks (Piercing, Slashing,
    and Blunt), the damage received is reduced by the target\u2019s Armor value.\nAdditionally,
    each time Armor reduces incoming damage, its value decreases by 1.\n\n<b>Resistances
    / Weaknesses</b>\n\nEach non-physical damage type has its own Resistance value,
    which decreases (or increases, if it is a Weakness) the amount of damage received
    from that type."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
