  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<b>---Bravery</b>\n\nBravery is an Attribute unique to Caravan Characters.
    It increases or decreases depending on how the battle unfolds, rising with success
    and falling under pressure.\n\nWhen Bravery reaches certain positive or negative
    thresholds, it affects the Character\u2019s performance in combat.\nIt also serves
    as a Resource used by certain abilities.\n\n<b>---Status Effects</b> (<b>X</b>
    = stacks)\n\n\u2022 <b>Burning:</b> Each <b>X</b> deals 2 damage to the Unit
    at the start of its Turn.\nThe Unit is also forced to spend AP to extinguish
    the flames, removing 3 <b>X</b> per AP spent.\n\n\u2022 <b>Frozen:</b> Each <b>X</b>
    reduces the Unit\u2019s AP by 1, and the effect decreases by 1 per Turn.\n\n\u2022
    <b>Stunned:</b> Each <b>X</b> causes the Unit to skip one Turn. The effect decreases
    by 1 per Turn."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 54a3d28dd6785154fac83f0c31a69b7c, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 1369702316804459117, guid: 54a3d28dd6785154fac83f0c31a69b7c, type: 2}
