  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Traveling underground makes sense for the caravan, as the <b>Black Breath</b>
    would advance more slowly than on the surface.\n\nUnfortunately, the only underground
    passage available leads through <b>Nedukazal</b>,\na proud and reclusive kingdom
    that dwells in the caverns with majesty. But after sending the vast majority
    of its hosts to the final battle against the Lich Kadryn, unknown beings seized
    the opportunity and emerged from the depths to plunder the kingdom, destroying
    it almost completely.\n\nThere are still settlements resisting the invaders,\nbut
    it is only a matter of time before <b>Nedukazal</b> \nceases to exist.\n\nThe
    caravan must now cross this kingdom,\nshrouded in darkness."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 54a3d28dd6785154fac83f0c31a69b7c, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 1369702316804459117, guid: 54a3d28dd6785154fac83f0c31a69b7c, type: 2}
