  m_text: "<b>Retinues</b> are specialized groups that travel with the caravan and
    serve a specific purpose.\n\nYou will always start with the <b>Merchants, Blacksmiths,
    and Healers Retinues</b>. As you travel, you can gain new <b>Retinues</b>, and
    they won\u2019t always be beneficial.\n\nYou can also lose one if the caravan
    is defeated in battle."
