  m_text: "With the <b>Resources</b> you\u2019ve gathered, your caravan is now <b>overloaded</b>.
    You can see it where the arrow points.\n\nEach <b>Ox</b> increases the caravan\u2019s
    <b>Carry Capacity</b>.\n\nTraveling while overloaded will reduce <b>Hope</b>
    and increase the caravan\u2019s fatigue.\n\nDon\u2019t worry: there\u2019s a
    way to fix it."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 54a3d28dd6785154fac83f0c31a69b7c, type: 2}
