  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<b>---Traits</b>\n\nEach character will randomly acquire different traits
    that can either improve or hinder their overall capabilities, both during the
    campaign and in combat.\n\n<b>---Activities</b>\n\nA character can perform various
    Activities while traveling with the caravan.\n\nRest, Training, and Guard are
    general activities available to everyone. In addition to these, each class has
    2 exclusive activities (randomized from 3 options).\n\nIt\u2019s important to
    assign each character\u2019s Activity carefully depending on the situation. For
    example, an injured character will recover faster while resting, or if there\u2019s
    a risk of ambush, assigning someone to Guard duty can be very helpful."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 54a3d28dd6785154fac83f0c31a69b7c, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 1369702316804459117, guid: 54a3d28dd6785154fac83f0c31a69b7c, type: 2}
