  m_text: "<b>---Rest</b>\n\nWhen resting, you may select a <b>Civil Task</b>, each
    with its own benefits and risks.\n\nOnce the rest is over, Fatigue will return
    to zero. In addition, a <b>Random Event</b> will occur, and the <b>Black Breath</b>
    will advance by 2.\n\n<b>---Exploration</b>\n\nAfter resting, an <b>Exploration
    Roll</b> will take place. Depending on the result and any modifiers affecting
    it (such as the Weather), it may reveal the types of future nodes along the caravan\u2019s
    path.\n\nThis is very important for choosing the most favorable route ahead."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 54a3d28dd6785154fac83f0c31a69b7c, type: 2}
