  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<b>---Abilities</b>\n\nBoth Caravan Characters and Enemies possess various
    Abilities they can use during their Turn.\nEach Ability has its own AP cost,
    Effects, Range, and <b>Cooldown</b>.\n\nAbilities with a <b>Cooldown</b> cannot
    be used again until it expires.\nExample: If an Ability has a 3-Turn Cooldown,
    it will decrease by 1 each Round and can be used again once it reaches 0.\n\n<b>---Exertion</b>\n\nSome
    Abilities allow borrowing a limited amount of AP from the next Turn.\nThis lets
    a Unit use an Ability even without enough AP, but the borrowed points will be
    subtracted from the Unit\u2019s AP on its following Turn.\n\nAdditionally, a
    Unit under Exertion will have its Defense reduced until next turn."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 54a3d28dd6785154fac83f0c31a69b7c, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 1369702316804459117, guid: 54a3d28dd6785154fac83f0c31a69b7c, type: 2}
