  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<b>---Gold</b>\n\nDespite the catastrophic situation, Gold remains the
    main form of exchange between survivors. It is used to hire services or purchase
    goods along the way.\nAny coins you don\u2019t spend during the journey can be
    used later at the <b>Port of Serria</b>.\n\n<b>---Supplies</b>\n\nEssential provisions
    for the Caravan\u2019s survival. When resting, Civilians consume 1, while Oxen
    consume 2.\n\n<b>---Materials</b>\n\nResources used for general upgrades to the
    caravan and specific retinues.\n\nBoth Supplies and Materials can be gathered
    from Resource Nodes or through a <b>Civil Task</b>."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 54a3d28dd6785154fac83f0c31a69b7c, type: 2}
