  m_text: '<b>---Enemies</b>


    During the journey, the caravan will face enemies
    specific to the current Zone, mixed with general enemies that can appear in any
    area (e.g. Bandits).


    <b>---Mechanics</b>


    Each Zone features a gameplay
    mechanic that reflects its main theme. These mechanics make every Zone feel like
    a distinct challenge.


    <b>---Modifiers</b>


    At times, Zones may include
    random modifiers that alter certain specific aspects of that area. These will
    be revealed beforehand so the player can choose accordingly.'
