      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<b>Resource Nodes</b> let you obtain <b>Materials</b> and <b>Supplies</b>
    when you arrive.\nThey also grant a gathering bonus if you rest here, but we
    won't rest yet. \n\n<b>Supplies</b> are essential goods that keep the caravan
    alive.\n\n<b>Materials</b> are used, among other things, to upgrade the caravan."
