  m_text: "You\u2019ve arrived at a <b>Battle node</b>.\nYou must clear it to continue.
    If you are defeated, the caravan will lose Civilians, Hope, and some Resources.\n\nOn
    this screen, choose which available heroes will defend the caravan.\n\nFor now,
    you only have a <b>Stalker</b>. Select him, then press <b>\"Start Battle\"</b>."
