      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "A battle takes place when the caravan enters a Combat Node or by diverse
    events.\n\nThe scene transitions to the Battlefield and will not return to the
    campaign map until the fight is resolved, whether in victory or defeat.\n\nThe
    objective of a battle is to defeat the enemies on the right-side grid before
    all your Characters fall.\n\nIn general, if you emerge victorious, the participating
    Characters will gain experience and you\u2019ll obtain resources. You\u2019ll
    then be allowed to continue your journey.\n\nIf you are defeated, beyond the
    Injuries your Characters will suffer, you\u2019ll lose several Civilians and
    Resources.\n\nIn Caravan Ambush and Boss battles, a defeat means the caravan
    has failed, and the game is over."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 54a3d28dd6785154fac83f0c31a69b7c, type: 2}
