  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'The Map represents the current Zone through which the caravan must travel
    to reach the final node of that Zone.


    It is composed of multiple Nodes
    connected by procedurally generated paths, creating different layouts each time
    a Zone is entered.


    <b>---Nodes</b>


    Each time the caravan arrives
    at a node, different outcomes will trigger depending on its type; some beneficial,
    others harmful. Also the <b>Black Breath</b> will advance by 1.


    <b>---Fatigue</b>


    When
    traveling from one node to another, the caravan gains +1 Fatigue (+2 on difficult
    paths). If not managed through rest, Fatigue will gradually begin to negatively
    affect the caravan, making it essential to Rest periodically.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 54a3d28dd6785154fac83f0c31a69b7c, type: 2}
