  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<b>---Oxen</b>\n\nThe Oxen accompany the caravan and serve as beasts of
    burden.\n\nEach Ox provides 25 <b>Carrying Capacity</b>, while each Supply takes
    up 1 and each Material takes up 2.\n\nIt\u2019s important to keep the <b>Carrying
    Capacity</b> within limits, since traveling while overburdened will cause the
    caravan to gain +1 extra Fatigue.\n\nTo deal with excess weight, you can discard
    Supplies (this slightly lowers Hope) or abandon Materials, which has no Hope
    penalty.\n\n\nIn critical moments, you may also sacrifice Oxen to obtain Supplies.
    \nEach sacrificed Ox provides 20 Supplies and lowers the Hope by 2."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 54a3d28dd6785154fac83f0c31a69b7c, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 1369702316804459117, guid: 54a3d28dd6785154fac83f0c31a69b7c, type: 2}
