      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<b>---Hope</b>\n\nExpresses the Civilians\u2019 overall optimism about
    reaching the port alive. As different events occur during the journey, Hope will
    shift for better or worse.\n\nHope itself, whenever a <b>Random Event</b> is
    triggered (whether by a Node or when Resting), will determine the odds of that
    Event being positive or negative. Higher Hope means greater chances of a positive
    outcome, and vice versa.\n\n<b>---Retinues</b>\n\nRetinues are groups of specialized
    Civilians you\u2019ll encounter along the way. Each Retinue has a number of associated
    Civilians and counts toward the final objective.\nIn addition, each one has its
    own mechanics that can help the caravan."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 54a3d28dd6785154fac83f0c31a69b7c, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 1369702316804459117, guid: 54a3d28dd6785154fac83f0c31a69b7c, type: 2}
  m_fontSharedMaterials: []
  m_fontMaterial: {fileID: 0}
  m_fontMaterials: []
