  m_text: "In short, <b>Characters</b> are a key resource for the Caravan, and each
    one is unique.\n\nBut remember: you can lose them <b>forever</b>. If they fall
    in combat, they will suffer an <b>Injury</b>. If they fall again in a later battle
    while still injured, they will die.\n\nWhen you\u2019re done reviewing the Character
    Menu, close it to continue the tutorial."
