  m_text: "The enemy has finished its turn, and a new <b>Round</b> begins. It\u2019s
    your <b>Stalker</b>\u2019s turn again: they\u2019ve recovered their <b>AP</b>
    and can act once more.\n\nNow that you\u2019re in the <b>Melee Column</b>, you
    can attack the enemy in the nearest occupied column (only enemies <b>in Front</b>
    count: same row or adjacent rows) using <b>melee</b> skills, such as <b>Short
    Sword</b>."
