  m_text: 'After days of relentless marching and battle, the caravan has crossed
    the zone and is now ready to continue its journey toward the Port of Serria.

    The
    next few days will be peaceful, giving the caravan a much-needed chance to rest
    and replenish.


    - Characters will recover from their wounds (but not Corruption).

    -
    You gain 120 Supplies and 40 Materials.

    - A new random Zone will begin.'
