  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "The caravan\u2019s path has led it to the outskirts of what was once called
    the <b>Forest of Glain</b>.\n\nUnfortunately, to the surprise of the caravan
    members, the chaos that spread after news of the imminent arrival of the <b>Black
    Breath</b> caused several groups of escaping desperate men to accidentally set
    ablaze vast portions of the forest.\nThe fire has spread across almost the entire
    region, and most of the animals and guardian spirits of the woods have perished
    in the flames.\n\nNow it is a land of death and ashes, where the spirits of the
    fallen have been empowered by the presence of the\nBreath, and the beings of
    the forest have risen in\nvengeance against any intruder who dares to\ncross
    it."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 54a3d28dd6785154fac83f0c31a69b7c, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 1369702316804459117, guid: 54a3d28dd6785154fac83f0c31a69b7c, type: 2}
