  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<b>---Breath''s Toxicity</b>


    The closer the Breath is to the caravan,
    the greater its deadly impact will be.

    If the caravan travels at a safe
    distance, this will lift their spirits, gradually restoring Hope.

    However,
    if the Breath reaches the caravan, Civilians and Oxen will begin to die, Hope
    will crumble, and <b>Corrupted</b> encounters will become far more frequent.



    <b>---Corrupted</b>


    Creatures
    twisted by the presence of the Breath, they have lost all will and now wander
    violently, driven by their physical torment.

    They may appear unexpectedly
    in any battle, but their frequency and strength increase dramatically when the
    caravan is engulfed by the Breath.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 54a3d28dd6785154fac83f0c31a69b7c, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 1369702316804459117, guid: 54a3d28dd6785154fac83f0c31a69b7c, type: 2}
  m_fontSharedMaterials: []
  m_fontMaterial: {fileID: 0}
  m_fontMaterials: []
