  m_text: "You\u2019ve reached the <b>Front Column (Melee)</b>. But moving diagonally
    costs <b>2 AP</b>, so you only have <b>1 AP</b> left, which isn\u2019t enough
    to use <b>Short Sword</b> this turn.\n\nInstead, use <b>\"Distract\"</b>: it
    costs <b>1 AP</b> and, if it hits, it applies a <b>debuff</b> to the enemy.\n\nUse
    <b>Distract</b> on the enemy, then end your turn with the highlighted button."
