  m_text: "Here you can choose a <b>Civil Task</b>, which will be carried out by
    the civilians during the day.\n\nBelow, you\u2019ll see your <b>Exploration</b>
    chance when resting: if it succeeds, you may reveal some nodes further along
    the path.\n\nYou\u2019ll also see the chance of being <b>Ambushed</b> while you
    rest."
