  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<b>---Range</b>\n\nRanged abilities can target enemies within the range
    specified in their description, taking into account the number of Columns and
    Rows between the user and the target to determine distance.\n\n<b>---Melee (Close
    Combat)</b>\n\nOnly if the user is in the first Column:\n\nMelee abilities normally
    reach the first enemy directly in front of the user.\n\u201CFront\u201D is considered
    the same Row and the adjacent ones (one above and one below).\n\nOn that Front,
    these attacks can only affect enemies located in the next occupied Column and
    never those positioned behind them.\n\nFor example: if the enemy is in the last
    Column and there are no other opponents blocking the way, it can be targeted."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 54a3d28dd6785154fac83f0c31a69b7c, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 1369702316804459117, guid: 54a3d28dd6785154fac83f0c31a69b7c, type: 2}
