  m_text: '<i>"Patrols will be dispatched to assist those caravans still searching
    for the path that leads them here."</i>


    Each Tier will add 2 <b>Militiamen</b>
    as reinforcements for the <b>Final Battle</b>.


    Additionally, each Tier
    increases by <b>10%</b> the chance that 2 <b>Militiamen</b> will join as reinforcements
    in battles faced by future caravans along the way.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 54a3d28dd6785154fac83f0c31a69b7c, type: 2}
