  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Battles are turn-based.

    This means that each Unit acts only when
    it is their Turn, and while one Unit is acting, no other Unit can do so (except
    through Reactions).


    <b>Initiative</b>


    Initiative is an attribute
    unique to each Unit. At the start of combat, all participants roll a 1d20 + Initiative
    check. Based on the results, Units are ordered from highest to lowest, determining
    the sequence of actions within the Round. This order remains the same throughout
    the entire battle.


    <b>Rounds</b>


    A Round represents the cycle in
    which all Units have taken their Turn. Once that occurs, a new Round begins.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 54a3d28dd6785154fac83f0c31a69b7c, type: 2}
