  m_text: "In this menu, you can view each <b>Character</b>\u2019s information: combat
    stats, traits, temporary effects, and more.\n\n<i>Currently</i>, there are <b>5
    Character Classes</b>, each with its own mechanics and playstyle.\n\nCharacters
    are generated <b>procedurally</b>: they start with <b>random</b> initial abilities
    from their <b>Class</b>, and they will learn new abilities at certain <b>Levels</b>."
