  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "The caravan\u2019s path narrows more and more as it ascends the steep
    slope, until it finally reaches the ancient and feared <b>Frozenwind Passage</b>.\n\nThere,
    the air grows dense and biting; a glacial wind blows relentlessly through the
    cracks in the rocks, producing a haunting whistle that seems to merge with the
    laments of those who once tried to cross and failed.\n\nYet the cold is not the
    only enemy. Near the cliffs and caverns that line the path lurks the <b>Kale'Tav
    Tribe</b>, a group of savages bound by a profane faith, fully aware of the danger
    drawing near.\n\nUnwilling to abandon their land, they have chosen\nto intensify
    their sacrifices in order to perform\na ritual that, in their naive belief, will
    protect\nthem from the <b>Black Breath</b>."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 54a3d28dd6785154fac83f0c31a69b7c, type: 2}
