  m_text: "This ties into the game\u2019s <b>Metaprogression</b>.\n\nEach time you
    start a new run (a caravan journey), <b>Corruption</b> increases by <b>1</b>,
    whether the caravan reaches its destination or not.\n\nWhen <b>Corruption</b>
    reaches its maximum, the civilians in <b>Serria</b> can no longer keep waiting.
    They must board the ships and depart, ending the run."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 54a3d28dd6785154fac83f0c31a69b7c, type: 2}
